      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLLY'S FOLLY (8) was out of in the placings when fifth last time but prior to that posted a slick 18.37 win over 318m at this track. Smart win two back and looks a key chance here. ADA TARO (3) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Grade 4 at this track. Has good speed and aided by a low draw. Can feature with the right run. GLADSTONE BAG (7) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Hard Style Chick (18.56) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Bold showing expected. HEADING SOUTH (1) warrants respect with the drop in journey.",
